101: ## Still removed
102: 
103: - independent World daemon or database;
104: - provider broker, automatic router and untriggered provider rebinding;
105: - capability registry beyond live provider discovery;
106: - callback, queue, fan-out or join orchestration;
107: - general MCP, RAG, Sandbox or connector platform;
108: - historical Rust World, Link, Edge, WCP, WXP, QUIC and wire layers;
109: - default replay of closed research experiments;
110: - duplicated Task, workflow, identity or verification models.
